{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"くしゅんっヾ(｡><)ｼ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/02/03/0174484/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みしゃみしゃと∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は乃木神社の近くに\n行ったから、初詣もまだして\nなかったしお参りしてきたよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたらとんでもない人混み(OωO )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え？！って驚いてたら\nみんなが手を上に伸ばしてて\nその方向を見てみたら\n豆を投げるお坊さんたちが\nいたの(((っ･ω･)っ°°°"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく考えたら、節分か！\nと気づきました(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、自分のことと\n真夏を応援してくださってる\n受験生の方が試験でうまく\nいきますよーにって\nお願いしてきました∩^ω^∩♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おみくじはなんと大吉ヽ(〃v〃)ﾉ♪\nうれし～♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"節分といえば！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋元家では毎年すこーしだけ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鬼はー外っ！\n福はー内っ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って豆まきをしてます(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ～°"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けどね、これをやっちゃうと\n次の日困るんですよ(-ω-；)いつも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぜだと思う？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お家の中にまいた豆はまぁ\n拾えばOKじゃないですか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けど、外にまいた豆は\n拾えなくてそのまま"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すると次の日。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鳥さんが外で勝手に会合を\n開いてしまうのです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなお豆を食べながら\nピヨピヨ話してるの( 'Θ' )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全くもぅ￣O￣)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんも豆まきしたり\n恵方巻き食べたり\nするのかな～？(((っ･ω･)っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さい頃はね、ビニール袋を\n赤く塗ってそれを着て\nお面もつけて鬼に変身したりも\nしてたんだよ(*`･ω･´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なつかし～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新コーナーヽ(｡･∀･)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お？！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから気が向いたときに\n一個前の記事からランダムに\n選んで写メのリクエストに\n答えてみようかな～とか\n思ってみてますヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃ、見たい写メがあれば\nコソッといつでも言ってみてねっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これも『まなったんと\nおしゃべりtime(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ♡』\nみたいに何か名前つけたいな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと考えとくっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんでいい案があったら\n参考にしちゃおうかなと\n思ってみたりする(人-ω-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/02/03/0174484/0001.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}